    <chapter xml:id="chap-equivalencies">
      <title>Equivalencies (40 min)</title>
      <introduction>
        <image source="hawaiian-canoe.jpeg" width="100%">
          <shortdescription>A fleet of traditional Hawaiian sailing canoes with white sails crossing rough open water under a dramatic stormy sky.</shortdescription>
        </image>
        <p><em>Now let's connect the measures, build a table of equivalencies, hunt for patterns, and discover new units using our body.</em></p>
      </introduction>
